{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22859","headline":"夜宿江浦闻元八改官因寄此什 · 白居易","name":"夜宿江浦闻元八改官因寄此什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君游丹陛已三迁，我泛沧浪欲二年。\n劒佩晓趋双凤阙，烟波夜宿一渔船。\n交亲尽在青云上，乡国遥抛白日边。\n若报生涯应笑杀，结茅栽芋种畲田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22859.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22859","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}